[[Jahai]] is an area in north-central [[Kourna]]. Most of Jahai appears to be contained in [[Jahai Bluffs]] as well as north of the bluffs. It contains the [[Fortress of Jahai]] and the [[Grand Cataract of Jahai]], which is where [[Turai Ossa]] bested [[Palawa Joko]] during the [[Battle of Jahai]].

